  "title": "Vote.org Applauds Federal Appeals Court for Key Voting Rights Decision",
  "summary": "Vote.org CEO Andrea Hailey issued the following statement after the Eighth Circuit Court of Appeals ruled that Arkansas cannot require voters to use a handwritten signature to register to vote, blocking a rule that effectively banned online voter registration tools in the state. Vote.org was a plaintiff in the case.",
